    "title": "Fort Peck homicide suspect arrested - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By PAUL HAMBY phamby@billingsgazette.com ,\n1 days ago Law enforcement arrested a suspect Tuesday accused of shooting a man dead on the Fort Peck Indian Reservation and wounding another. Ethan Murphy, 26, was identified as the suspect in the shooting, which occurred Sunday night in Wolf Point. His arrest \"was handled swiftly and safely,\" according to as statement posted to social media. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
